      <p begin="01:16.700" end="01:19.610" ttm:agent="v1">참 못 말려, 나도 참 못돼</p>
      <p begin="01:19.610" end="01:22.820" ttm:agent="v1">No, never, 내가 먼저 말 못 해</p>
      <p begin="01:22.820" end="01:26.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Please, 오해하지 말고, 들어, get it right (get it right)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.130" end="01:29.390" ttm:agent="v1">솔직히 나 답답해서 죽겠어</p>
      <p begin="01:29.390" end="01:32.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">갑자기 날 안아줘도 좋아 (ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:32.580" end="01:35.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">분위기로 대신해도 좋아 (ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:35.370" end="01:38.650" ttm:agent="v1">그게 꼭 말이 아니면 어때?</p>
