      <p begin="02:07.040" end="02:12.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">쉽지 않은 거 나도 아는데 (listen, my boy)</p>
      <p begin="02:12.590" end="02:19.890" ttm:agent="v1">먼저 다가와 줘, 네가 먼저 말해줘, oh, whoa</p>
      <p begin="02:19.890" end="02:23.430" ttm:agent="v1">Same, oh, same, oh, same, 똑같은 맘인데</p>
      <p begin="02:23.430" end="02:26.500" ttm:agent="v1">No way, no way, no, 먼저 말 못 해</p>
      <p begin="02:26.500" end="02:29.360" ttm:agent="v1">오래오래 못 기다려줘</p>
      <p begin="02:29.360" end="02:32.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Better hurry up, oh, 우린 이미 똑같아 (ah)</p>
      <p begin="02:32.490" end="02:36.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Samе, oh, same, oh, same, 똑같은 맘인데 (you)</p>
      <p begin="02:36.070" end="02:39.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No way, no way, no, 먼저 말 못 해 (so wait)</p>
